[gd_scene format=3]

; The Sluice, east of the Cistern (map offset (176.5, -4.5)): the floodgate channel that drained the cathedral.
; A long low gallery stepping down eastward beside the channel, under three gates. The first hangs half-raised
; (walk under it); the walkway then breaks over a culvert pit (jump it, or climb out of the shallow water at its
; east side); the last gate stands closed to its waist between two buttresses, the water spilling over it (climb
; the buttresses and cross its top). A Limpet sleeps on that gate; a Gleaner picks at scrap by the far door.
; Everything here is the base moveset: this is the road to the Harpoon for a pilgrim without Mag-grip.

